        </header>
        <ul class="items">
          <li><span class="line">Designed and implemented an ACA-CRNet-based restoration model</span><span class="line">Bandwise masks blend original and restored images to limit changes in cloud-free areas</span></li>
          <li><span class="line">Rebuilt and published SEN12MS-CR (389 GB → 240 GB)</span><span class="line">Streaming loader for training without storing the full dataset locally</span></li>
          <li><span class="line">Built a shared training and evaluation package to compare four candidate models</span><span class="line">4-GPU DDP training; unified metric computation</span></li>
          <li><span class="line">Reimplemented contextual attention with PyTorch SDPA for the final model</span><span class="line">Feature-decomposition experiment, inference: VRAM 6,264 → 724 MB; 4.63 → 7.88 img/s</span></li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="entry project" aria-label="Click-bait Seeker">
        <header class="project-header">
          <div class="row"><h3><span class="entry-title">Click-bait Seeker</span><span class="entry-desc">Chrome extension for clickbait classification</span></h3><p class="date">Sep 2024 – Dec 2024</p></div>
          <div class="row meta"><p class="context">Dongguk University Open Source Software Project · Team of 4</p><div class="links" aria-label="Click-bait Seeker resources"><a href="https://github.com/CSID-DGU/2024-02-CSC4004-2-2-NewEngineeringCenterGhost">Project code</a><a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/blcclfjholbpgmmbnghodhlkagepjbbh">Chrome Web Store</a></div></div>
        </header>
        <ul class="items">
          <li><span class="line">Trained Jamo-level FastText on a separate Korean corpus for typo robustness</span><span class="line">Preprocessed about 730K AI Hub articles; trained a Transformer classifier</span></li>
